WEBVTT

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:17.250
It hurts...

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:19.290
It really hurts...

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:35.260
What's taking Ninomiya so long?

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:43.360
Huh? What?

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:48.530
What's that?

00:00:48.530 --> 00:00:51.360
They keep coming out of nowhere!

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:53.700
What do we do, Ninomiya?

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:58.290
You guys! Let's coordinate together
and take them out!

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:21.690
Thanks for saving us.

00:01:21.690 --> 00:01:24.440
You guys are really strong.

00:01:24.440 --> 00:01:26.650
Hah, you could say that.

00:01:26.650 --> 00:01:30.320
All you did was shoot glue,
Mr. Ninomiya...

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:36.620
Wait, Ninomiya, what's going on?
Who are these gentlemen?

00:01:36.620 --> 00:01:40.040
These are the scout and maintenance
teams for Belza's Bodyguards,

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:42.580
who came up from the fifth floor.

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:47.710
Apparently, we're all trapped
here on the fourth floor.

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:48.960
Huh?

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:52.220
What?!

00:01:56.420 --> 00:02:00.720
THE DUNGEON OF BLACK COMPANY

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:04.470
THE DUNGEON OF BLACK COMPANY

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:26.230
Ugh, the path to
the third floor is blocked!

00:03:26.230 --> 00:03:29.480
We're really trapped here.

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:32.650
The path to the fifth floor
is in a similar state.

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:37.740
So we can't go up or down?
What do we do, Ninomiya?

00:03:37.740 --> 00:03:40.780
The highest priority for us
is to proceed deeper,

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:45.120
but until we find out why we're trapped,
there's not much we can do.

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:48.960
Hey, old man,
what happened on the fifth floor?

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:53.340
It happened suddenly, a few days ago...

00:03:53.340 --> 00:03:58.430
The Bodyguards, as always, were taking
on the large monsters on the fifth floor.

00:03:58.430 --> 00:04:00.840
We were standing by.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:03.390
But then, everything started to rumble,

00:04:03.390 --> 00:04:06.310
and the entrance to
the floor began to collapse.

00:04:06.310 --> 00:04:09.810
We all rushed to escape.

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:12.860
We made it because we were
the support group placed in the back.

00:04:12.860 --> 00:04:16.150
We had to leave the Bodyguards
behind on the fifth floor...

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:20.280
What? Are they all right?

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:22.410
Probably...

00:04:22.410 --> 00:04:24.370
What do you mean "probably"?

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:31.080
So what is the fifth floor like?

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:34.170
Well, it's a very strange floor.

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:36.050
There aren't any weak monsters at all.

00:04:36.050 --> 00:04:39.630
Just two large monsters
in front of the gate.

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:43.180
Oh, that's it? Only two monsters?

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:49.560
But they're absurdly strong. We haven't
even found a way to deal with them yet.

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:55.110
So the Bodyguards are
still stuck on the fifth floor?

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:57.610
Yeah. We don't contribute
to their combat ability at all,

00:04:57.610 --> 00:05:00.400
so they're still strong by themselves,

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:04.240
but without an exit available,
they have to be careful.

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:06.790
There seems to be something going on

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:09.790
in the dungeon that's
beyond our understanding.

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:11.960
Well, whatever the case may be,

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:14.130
our first order of business
is to establish a base

00:05:14.130 --> 00:05:17.130
and figure out what's going on.

00:05:17.130 --> 00:05:21.880
Don't worry about the base.
We've already built one.

00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:28.810
Ugh!

00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:31.230
Monsters everywhere!

00:05:33.650 --> 00:05:34.730
What do we do?

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:38.150
It's obvious! I'll take them on!

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:45.870
Are they fighting each other?

00:05:49.830 --> 00:05:53.160
Oh, how I've missed you!

00:05:56.670 --> 00:06:03.090
After you went missing,
Master Ninomiya, I... I...!

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:07.100
Who's this lady? Your mistress?
Is that your child?

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:11.560
Ch-Child?! What's going on, Mr. Ninomiya?!

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:15.940
Don't strangle me!
I don't know who this is!

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:21.070
How cruel! I've waited
so long for your return!

00:06:21.070 --> 00:06:23.950
Did you legally
recognize your offspring?!

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:26.450
Hey! Snap out of it!

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:29.780
Who are you, anyway?!

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:33.830
Perhaps this will help you recognize me...

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:44.880
It's been too long, Master Ninomiya.

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:47.220
Dungeon Ant Queen!

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:53.640
When did you learn to transform like that?

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:55.850
Just a little while ago.

00:06:55.850 --> 00:06:58.520
We were being hunted recently, so...

00:06:58.520 --> 00:07:01.320
This form is very convenient.

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:05.320
I can sneak into
human-controlled lands, like I just did.

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:08.870
Also, it makes it easier
for me to hold her like this.

00:07:08.870 --> 00:07:14.290
And this is "Majin 2."
Why are you with her?

00:07:14.290 --> 00:07:16.670
I met her in the dungeon.

00:07:16.670 --> 00:07:20.040
You can relax now, Shia.
That's not his secret child!

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:21.630
Wh-What?

00:07:21.630 --> 00:07:26.090
Stop phrasing it like
I was concerned about that!

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:29.180
After you suddenly disappeared,
Master Ninomiya,

00:07:29.180 --> 00:07:34.270
the dungeon experienced a terrible tremor,
followed by rapid changes.

00:07:34.270 --> 00:07:39.480
I decided to lead my subordinates away
from the epicenter of the changes, but...

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:43.020
That's when I met her.

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:45.740
Born as a substitute ruler of
the dungeon to replace Ms. Rim,

00:07:45.740 --> 00:07:49.910
many amongst us were
rightfully terrified of her. But...

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:53.740
She's...

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:57.160
So cute! I want to protect her so bad!

00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:59.080
What kind of tone is that...?

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:04.960
The various irregularities occurring
in the dungeon are connected to her.

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:09.220
If she falls ill, the dungeon
also experiences problems.

00:08:09.220 --> 00:08:13.100
The Majin and the dungeon are in sync.

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:16.890
Originally, the Majin was in charge of
controlling the circulation of magic power

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:18.730
within the dungeon.

00:08:18.730 --> 00:08:24.770
But when Ms. Rim left
the dungeon and went outside...

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:24.810
So hungry. Need meat.

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:29.320
...the second Majin,
an irregularity, was born.

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:36.080
And now that the second Majin is weakened,
the dungeon is in utter chaos.

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:42.710
As a result, the flow of power
in the earth has been disturbed,

00:08:42.710 --> 00:08:44.460
and the ecosystem is in chaos,

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:48.260
which further weakens
the Majin in a negative spiral.

00:08:48.260 --> 00:08:52.090
However, that also means
that if we can make her healthy,

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:55.970
it would also return
the dungeon to its normal state.

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:59.730
Please, Master Ninomiya,
please save this child!

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:04.560
I am willing to sacrifice anything
to help make that happen.

00:09:08.530 --> 00:09:12.160
Night is falling in the dungeon...

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:15.450
This is beyond mysterious;
it's just plain absurd.

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:27.130
So troublesome...

00:09:31.220 --> 00:09:34.470
Hmm? Is that Rim?

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:37.100
What's she doing?

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:42.520
Is this food for the child?

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:44.100
Yes.

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:50.280
Mandragora meat, a special!

00:09:50.280 --> 00:09:54.070
I'm so lucky to be able to find it.

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:55.780
You can eat it.

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:00.330
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:04.170
She isn't this violent usually...
I wonder what's wrong?

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:10.550
Hey!

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:14.510
Come on.

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:15.890
Please behave.

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:31.690
Wow, you look very good, Ms. Rim.

00:10:34.030 --> 00:10:35.490
Friends...

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:45.750
Ouch...

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:48.710
Does she hate Rim?

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:53.590
Coming to think of it,
you did defeat her once, Ms. Rim.

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:57.010
Perhaps she is afraid of you,
in an instinctive way.

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:13.940
Why are you out here
looking so melancholic?

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:23.750
It's interesting how you've decided
to play nanny for the small one.

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:26.210
I wanted to visit the outside.

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:30.460
But I had no idea that was a bad thing.

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:34.840
Because of that, she was born weak.

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:38.050
I was selfish and caused trouble.

00:11:42.310 --> 00:11:47.520
Kinji, please help me save her.

00:11:47.520 --> 00:11:52.400
Oh, fine. I guess we're companions
who share meals and all that.

00:11:52.400 --> 00:11:54.150
I'll figure something out.

00:11:55.940 --> 00:11:59.910
In exchange, though,
you must cut down on your food costs.

00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:02.780
Impossible.

00:12:08.710 --> 00:12:13.420
Ninomiya, why did you
gather everyone at this hour?

00:12:13.420 --> 00:12:17.260
I wanted to update you all on the
direction we'll be taking from here.

00:12:17.260 --> 00:12:18.720
Direction?

00:12:18.720 --> 00:12:23.680
Currently, we are unable to progress
or retreat from this fourth floor.

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:28.940
That is caused by the disturbance in the
circulation of magic power in the dungeon.

00:12:28.940 --> 00:12:35.070
Yes, but even knowing that, it's not like
there's anything we can do about it.

00:12:35.070 --> 00:12:36.320
Yes, yes.

00:12:36.320 --> 00:12:43.280
But there is. Put simply,
this dungeon has intestinal problems.

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:46.410
All we have to do is improve that.

00:12:48.250 --> 00:12:51.370
I'll meddle with this dungeon
to my heart's content

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:54.420
and put everything under
my own personal management!

00:12:56.000 --> 00:13:00.220
Now, let's rebuild this dungeon!

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:33.670
Looks like that worked out.

00:13:33.670 --> 00:13:38.380
Now the aquatic monsters here
will regain their normal strength,

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:41.130
which will prevent them
from being hunted too easily.

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:43.470
Yes, precisely.

00:13:43.470 --> 00:13:47.850
The ecosystem in the dungeon is
just about as mixed up as it could get.

00:13:47.850 --> 00:13:51.270
Our mission is to straighten that out.

00:13:51.270 --> 00:13:54.850
Master Ninomiya, thank you
for your efforts to save the child.

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:59.480
Let's go, everyone!
Ninomiya's Rebuilding Project begins now!

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:00.990
Yeah!

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:12.960
No!

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:25.970
I have to be the grown-up...

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:36.150
You're burning up! Are you all right?!

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:43.530
Doesn't seem okay...

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:54.210
I have to do something!

00:15:08.600 --> 00:15:12.810
This won't do. I need more ice...

00:15:12.810 --> 00:15:18.310
But that was all the ice we had...
What should I do?

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:34.410
Kinji said it's very cold over there.

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:47.180
Look how happy they are.

00:15:47.180 --> 00:15:51.470
The bear-moles really
love tree-type monster seeds.

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:53.930
But why guide them here?

00:15:53.930 --> 00:16:00.440
Having them eat the seeds stops
the rampant spread of the forest.

00:16:08.360 --> 00:16:10.160
So cold...

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:14.080
Cold, but lots of ice...

00:16:37.060 --> 00:16:42.860
W-Wait a minute! What is this?!

00:16:43.650 --> 00:16:46.480
Hop-rabbits were too active
in one specific area.

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:49.360
Shia! Run as far as you can!

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:52.620
Why do I have to dress like this?!

00:16:52.620 --> 00:16:57.950
Apparently, hop-rabbits during this season
will chase females regardless of race.

00:16:57.950 --> 00:16:59.830
That's why. Now go!

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:36.200
You have to eat.

00:17:52.760 --> 00:17:55.220
Oh! She ate it!

00:17:58.520 --> 00:18:02.440
Now the dungeon rebuild
is nearing its climax!

00:18:02.440 --> 00:18:05.650
The creatures here started
excreting venom due to stress,

00:18:05.650 --> 00:18:09.650
because a violent and powerful monster
settled in this pond.

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:14.740
Hmm... It'd be too difficult
to dive in and find the big monster.

00:18:14.740 --> 00:18:17.780
Right! Let's just drain the whole pond!

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:28.130
Ah! I didn't know slimes
could grow to be so big!

00:18:28.130 --> 00:18:31.550
I wanted to see how much water they
could hold. Turns out it's nearly endless!

00:18:31.550 --> 00:18:34.930
That said, where is the monster?

00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:46.480
Here it comes!

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:51.690
It sucked up the mana from the earth
and grew to an absurd size!

00:18:51.690 --> 00:18:53.950
How terrifying...

00:18:53.950 --> 00:18:58.070
But if we defeat it, we should be able
to normalize the mana circulation of the

00:18:58.070 --> 00:18:59.240
entire fourth floor!

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:03.580
One final job, huh?
I'm glad it's so simple!

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:07.080
Now you'll regret ever seeing me!

00:19:16.010 --> 00:19:17.510
Rim.

00:19:25.770 --> 00:19:29.520
Oh! You're healthy now!

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:38.870
Wait, did you just say my name?

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:43.790
Rim...

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:48.120
Hey, Rim!

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:49.710
Kinji!

00:19:55.470 --> 00:19:58.930
Wow, you're a mess.

00:19:58.930 --> 00:20:01.180
Look, she's healthy now.

00:20:01.180 --> 00:20:05.060
Looks like it. Good job, Rim.

00:20:06.690 --> 00:20:09.850
I guess this one opened up to Rim only...

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:13.860
"This one"? Why not give
her a proper name?

00:20:13.860 --> 00:20:17.570
I remember, humans like
to give names to individuals.

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:19.490
What would be good?

00:20:19.490 --> 00:20:21.530
Rim, you think of something.

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:23.370
Me?

00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:27.460
I'm sure she'll like it much
more than anything I give her.

00:20:27.460 --> 00:20:30.130
Hmm...

00:20:33.340 --> 00:20:34.840
Okay, then,

00:20:34.840 --> 00:20:36.090
Sky!

00:20:36.090 --> 00:20:38.170
Sky?

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:41.550
Sky? Why did you choose that as her name?

00:20:41.550 --> 00:20:46.180
It was the first thing that I saw outside
the dungeon that I was impressed by!

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:47.600
Also...

00:20:51.440 --> 00:20:55.440
I really liked how the sky looked
when I was out walking with Ranga.

00:21:00.160 --> 00:21:03.950
The sky you saw with Ranga?
What's that about?

00:21:03.950 --> 00:21:07.040
It's a secret between the two of us!

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:11.210
My name is "Sky"?

00:21:11.210 --> 00:21:13.630
Wow, she speaks!

00:21:13.630 --> 00:21:17.130
Let's eat lots of tasty things together!

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:18.880
Tasty things?

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:23.430
Yes, tasty things, lots of them!

00:21:23.430 --> 00:21:25.930
Yes, I want to eat...

00:21:28.850 --> 00:21:31.520
What's wrong Sky?! Are you hurting?!

00:21:31.520 --> 00:21:33.190
Why all of a sudden...?

00:21:33.190 --> 00:21:35.860
I don't know. I don't know, but...

00:21:35.860 --> 00:21:39.820
There may be something
gravely wrong with the dungeon.

00:21:52.210 --> 00:21:54.080
Sonya... Sonya!

00:21:54.080 --> 00:21:56.710
Wake up, Sonya!

00:21:56.710 --> 00:22:01.510
Remember we promised
to conquer the dungeon together!

00:22:04.010 --> 00:22:05.720
Why...?

00:22:05.720 --> 00:22:10.680
I thought there were only supposed
to be two boss monsters on this floor...

00:22:10.680 --> 00:22:14.230
How come there are so many of them now?!
